title: "Crop NDVI Signature Library"
message: "If you use this repository or build upon its methodology, please cite the associated scientific work."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ahmed"
    given-names: "Dania Ibnomer Mohamed"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1794-3726"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DaniaIbnomer/crop-ndvi-signature-library"
url: "https://github.com/DaniaIbnomer/crop-ndvi-signature-library"
abstract: >
  A research prototype for temporal Earth Observation analysis and
  crop NDVI signature characterization using Sentinel-2 imagery and
  Google Earth Engine. The repository continues research originally
  developed through a regional Young Professionals project associated
  with the Eastern Nile Technical Regional Office (ENTRO) of the
  Nile Basin Initiative (NBI).
keywords:
  - Earth Observation
  - Remote Sensing
  - GIS
  - Sentinel-2
  - NDVI
  - crop phenology
  - crop identification
  - agricultural monitoring
  - irrigation management
  - Google Earth Engine
  - time-series analysis
